          "say": "A useful trace can preserve request identity, prompt and evidence versions, decisions, timings, and usage without storing the operator message. Our exporter selects fields from a positive allowlist and checks identifiers against its supplied host registry. Watch raw message and generated-answer fields remain outside the exported record.",
